---
description: CI linter rules for every file of the api-doc-viewer module.
globs: frontend/api-doc-viewer/**/*
---

Once a feature under `frontend/api-doc-viewer/` is finished, apply the `api-doc-viewer-ci-linters` skill before a commit.
CI lints every file a pull request touches as a whole, so the rules apply to the lines you did not write as well.
